  "reasoning": "The defendant, a private individual, repeatedly obtained money by abusing his relationship with a government official (receiving 300 万, 250 万, 200 万) – this constitutes the crime of receiving bribes (受贿). He also paid money to officials to obtain favorable treatment (100 万 and 35 万), which is the crime of giving bribes (行贿). The 35 万 was paid on behalf of his company, so it also fits the specific offense of unit bribery (单位行贿). No other distinct offenses are evident.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]受贿;行贿;单位行贿<eoa>"
